	"name": "Undying Aspect",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/sundries/flags/banner-standard-moon.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p><strong>Passive Effect:</strong> You gain resistance to necrotic damage.</p><p><strong>Active Effect: </strong><em><strong>Immobilising Touch.</strong></em> As your action, you touch one creature within melee range. The target must make a Constitution Saving Throw against your Spell DC (or Maneuver DC if you can’t cast spells), or be [[/condition id=paralyzed]] for 1 minute. At the end of each of their turn, the target can repeat the save to shake off the effect.</p>",
